      "system": {
        "actionType": {
          "value": "passive"
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Teleportation effects can pass through the barrier, as can visual effects (since the wall is invisible). Wall of force is immune to counteracting effects of its level or lower, but the wall is automatically destroyed by a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.r7ihOgKv19eJQnik]{Disintegrate} spell of any rank.</p>",
